    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Evolution of the BFSI Industry</title>
      <p>The BFSI sector has undergone significant transformation, from the early days of traditional banking to the modern digital landscape. The advent of digital banking, mobile payments, and online insurance services has reshaped the industry. Today, financial institutions are embracing digital transformation to offer better customer service, improve operational efficiency, and manage risk effectively.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Early Innovations in Financial Services</title>
      <p>The origins of banking can be traced back to ancient civilizations, where rudimentary systems for exchanging goods and services were developed. Over time, banking evolved with the introduction of paper money, checks, and the establishment of central banks. The 20th century saw the rise of commercial banking, along with innovations in credit and investment services.</p>
    </section>
